# Progress — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

> Progress and changes combined in one file. The upper half "Progress Overview" maintains a module status table (a glance at the whole picture);
> the lower half "Changelog" appends one narrative entry per commit (symptom / root cause / decision / verification result), newest first.
> When a key decision is involved, also append a structured entry (What/Why/Changes) to `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
> The "Changelog" only keeps entries from the current month; at the first batch wrap-up of each month, older entries are cut into `docs/archive/Progress-<YYYY-MM>.md` (see the "Monthly changelog archiving" rule in CLAUDE.md). The "Progress Overview" table is never archived.

